{"id":"segunda","lemma":"segunda","pos":"noun","rank":664,"glosses":["second gear","double meaning"],"ipa":"/seˈɡunda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"segundas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-segunda.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es de segunda mano.","en":"It's second-hand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442585","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"Lo compré en una tienda de segunda mano.","en":"I bought it at a thrift shop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804530","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tent"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"No tendrás una segunda oportunidad.","en":"You won't get a second chance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516142","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"opportunity"}]},{"text":"Todo el mundo se merece una segunda oportunidad.","en":"Everyone deserves a second chance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1592","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to deserve","l":"merecer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"opportunity"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"everyone, everybody"]]},{"text":"Tengo unas treinta primas segundas.","en":"I have about thirty second cousins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456776","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"an","l":"un"},{"g":"thirty"},{"g":"first","l":"primo"},null]}]}